      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5589,
      "bookHadithIndex": 51,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Hurairah that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade soaking (fruits) in Ad-Dubba', Al-Muzaffat, An-Naqir, Al-Hantam, and every intoxicant is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5589-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5589-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5589-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b178",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5590,
      "bookHadithIndex": 52,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Aishah that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"Do not soak (fruits) in Ad-Dubba', An-Naqir, Al-Hantam, and every intoxicant is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5590-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5590-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5590-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b179",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5591,
      "bookHadithIndex": 53,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Every drink that intoxicates is unlawful.'\" Qutaibah (one of the narrators) said: \"From the Prophet [SAW]",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5591-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5591-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5591-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b17a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5592,
      "bookHadithIndex": 54,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Aishah, may Allah be pleased with her, that :The Messenger of Allah [SAW] was asked about mead and he said: \"Every drink that intoxicates is unlawful.\" This is the wording of Suwaid",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5592-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5592-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5592-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b17b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5593,
      "bookHadithIndex": 55,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah, may Allah be pleased with her, that :The Messenger of Allah [SAW] was asked about mead and he said: \"Every drink that intoxicates is unlawful,\" and mead is made from honey",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5593-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5593-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5593-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b17c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5594,
      "bookHadithIndex": 56,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Aishah that:The Prophet [SAW] was asked about mead and he said: \"Every drink that intoxicates is unlawful.\" And mead is a drink made of honey",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5594-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5594-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5594-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b17d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5595,
      "bookHadithIndex": 57,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Musa said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Every intoxicant is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5595-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5595-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5595-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b17e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5596,
      "bookHadithIndex": 58,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Burdah that his father said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] sent Mu'adh and me to Yemen. Mu'adh said: 'You are sending us to a land where the people have many kinds of drinks. What should I drink?' He said: 'Drink, but do not drink any intoxicant",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5596-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5596-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5596-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b17f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5597,
      "bookHadithIndex": 59,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Musa said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Every intoxicant is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5597-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5597-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5597-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b180",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5598,
      "bookHadithIndex": 60,
      "text": "Al-Aswad bin Shaiban As-Sadusi said:\"I heard 'Ata' being asked by a man: 'We travel and drinks are offered to us in the marketplaces, and we do not know what kind of vessels they were prepared in.' He said: 'Every intoxicant is unlawful.' He repeated the question and he said: 'Every intoxicant is unlawful.' He repeated the question and he said: 'It is as I have told you",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5598-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad Maqtu"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5598-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad Maqtu"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5598-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b181",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5599,
      "bookHadithIndex": 61,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn Sirin said:\"Every intoxicant is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5599-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "-"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5599-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b182",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5600,
      "bookHadithIndex": 62,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Abdul-Malik bin At-Tufail Al-Jazari said:\"Umar bin 'Abdul-Aziz wrote to us, saying: 'Do not drink the thickened juice of grapes (obtained by boiling it down) until two-third of it has gone and one-third is left. And every intoxicant is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5600-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad Maqtu"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5600-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Daif Isnaad Maqtu"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5600-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Daif"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b183",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5601,
      "bookHadithIndex": 63,
      "text": "It was narrated that As-Sa'q bin Hazn said:\"Umar bin 'Abdul-'Aziz wrote to 'Adiy bin Artah (saying): 'Every intoxicant is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5601-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Hasan Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5601-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5601-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b184",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5602,
      "bookHadithIndex": 64,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Musa Al-Ash'ari that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: \"Every intoxicant is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5602-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5602-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5602-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b185",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5603,
      "bookHadithIndex": 65,
      "text": "Abu Bakr bin Abi Musa narrated that his father said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] sent me to Yemen and I said: 'O Messenger of Allah, there are (different kinds of) drinks there, what should I drink, and what should I refrain from?' He said: 'What are they?' I said: 'Al-Bit' (mead) and Al-Mizr (beer).' He said: 'What are mead and beer?' I said: 'Mead is a drink made from honey and beer is a drink made from grains.' The Messenger of Allah [SAW] said: 'Do not drink any intoxicant, for I have forbidden all intoxicants",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5603-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Hasan Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5603-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5603-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b186",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5604,
      "bookHadithIndex": 66,
      "text": "It was narrated from Abu Burdah that his father said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] sent me to Yemen and I said: 'O Messenger of Allah, there are drinks there which they call Al-Bit' (mead) and Al-Mizr (beer).' He said: 'What is mead (and beer)?' I said: 'A drink made from honey, and beer is made from barley.' He said: 'Every intoxicant is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5604-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5604-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5604-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b187",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5605,
      "bookHadithIndex": 67,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] delivered a Khutbah and quoted the Verse about Khamr. A man said: 'O Messenger of Allah, what do you think about Al-Mizr (beer)?' He said: 'What is beer?' He said: 'A (drink) from grains that is made in Yemen.' He said: 'Does it intoxicate?' He said: 'Yes.' He said: 'Every intoxicant is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5605-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5605-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5605-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b188",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5606,
      "bookHadithIndex": 68,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Al-Juwairiyah said:\"I heard Ibn 'Abbas when he was asked: 'Advise us about Badhiq (a drink made from the juice of grapes slightly boiled).' He said: 'Muhammad came before Badhiq (i.e., it was not known during his time), but everything that intoxicates is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5606-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5606-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5606-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b189",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5607,
      "bookHadithIndex": 69,
      "text": "Amr bin Shu'aib narrated from his father, from his grandfather, that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"What intoxicates in large amounts, a small amount of it is unlawful",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5607-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5607-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Hasan Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5607-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b18a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5608,
      "bookHadithIndex": 70,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Amir bin Sa'd, from his father, that:The Prophet [SAW] said: \"I forbid to you small amounts of whatever intoxicates in large amounts",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5608-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5608-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5608-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b18b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5609,
      "bookHadithIndex": 71,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Amir bin Sa'd, from his father, that:The Prophet [SAW] forbade a small amount of whatever intoxicates in large amounts",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5609-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5609-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5609-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b18c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5610,
      "bookHadithIndex": 72,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Hurairah said:\"I know that the Messenger of Allah [SAW] was fasting, so I prepared some Nabidh for him to break his fast that I had prepared for him in a gourd. I brought it to him and he said: 'Bring it here.' So I brought it closer and it was bubbling. He said: 'Throw it against the wall (throw it away), for this is the drink of one who does not believe in Allah or the Last Day",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5610-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5610-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5610-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b18d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5611,
      "bookHadithIndex": 73,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Ali - may Allah honor his face - said:\"The Prophet [SAW] forbade to me to use gold rings, Al-Qassi, Al-Mitharah and Al-Ji'ah (a barley drink)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5611-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5611-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5611-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b18e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5612,
      "bookHadithIndex": 74,
      "text": "Sa'sa'ah said to 'Ali bin Abi Talib - may Allah honor his face - :\"Forbid to us, O Commander of the Believers! What the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade to you.\" He said: \"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade me from using Ad-Dubba' and Al-Hantam",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5612-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5612-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5612-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b18f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5613,
      "bookHadithIndex": 75,
      "text": "It was narrated from Jabir that :(fruits) would be soaked for the Prophet [SAW] in a small vessel made of stone",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5613-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5613-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5613-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b190",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5614,
      "bookHadithIndex": 76,
      "text": "It was narrated that Tawus said:\"A man said to Ibn 'Umar: 'Did the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbid soaking (fruits) in earthenware jars?' He said: 'Yes.' Tawus said: 'By Allah, I heard that from him",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5614-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5614-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5614-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b191",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5615,
      "bookHadithIndex": 77,
      "text": "It was narrated that Sulaiman At-Taimi and Ibrahim bin Maisarah said:\"We heard Tawus say: 'A man came to Ibn 'Umar and said: Did the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbid soaking (fruits) in earthenware jars? He said: 'Yes.' Ibrahim added in his Hadith: \"And Ad-Dubba' (gourds)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5615-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5615-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5615-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b192",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5616,
      "bookHadithIndex": 78,
      "text": "Ibn 'Abbas said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade soaking (fruits) in earthenware jars",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5616-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5616-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5616-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b193",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5617,
      "bookHadithIndex": 79,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ibn 'Umar said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Al-Hantam. I (the narrator) said: \"What is Al-Hantam?\" He said: \"The earthenware jar",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5617-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5617-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5617-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b194",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5618,
      "bookHadithIndex": 80,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Maslamah said:\"I heard 'Abdul-'Aziz - that is, bin Asid At-Tahi from Al-Basrah - say: 'Ibn Az-Zubair was asked about soaking (fruits) in earthenware jars and he said: \"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade us from that",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5618-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5618-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5618-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b195",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5619,
      "bookHadithIndex": 81,
      "text": "It was narrated that Sa'eed bin Jubair said:\"We asked Ibn 'Umar about Nabidh made in an earthenware jar and he said: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade that.' So I went to Ibn 'Abbas and said to him: 'Today I heard something that surprised me.' He said: 'What was it?' I said: 'I asked Ibn 'Umar about Nabidh made in an earthenware jar and he said: The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade it.' He said: 'Ibn 'Umar spoke the truth.' I said: 'What is an earthenware jar?' He said: 'Anything that is made of clay",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5619-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5619-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5619-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b196",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5620,
      "bookHadithIndex": 82,
      "text": "It was narrated that Sa'eed bin Jubair said:\"I was with Ibn 'Umar when he was asked about Nabidh made in an earthenware jar. He said: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade it.' I got upset when I heard that, so I went to Ibn 'Abbas and said: 'Ibn 'Umar was asked about something, and I found it difficult.' He said: 'What was it?' I said: 'He was asked about Nabidh made in an earthenware jar.' He said: 'He spoke the truth; the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade it.' I said: 'What is an earthenware jar?' He said: 'Anything that is made of clay",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5620-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5620-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5620-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b197",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5621,
      "bookHadithIndex": 83,
      "text": "It was narrated that Ash-Shaibani said:\"I heard Ibn Abi Awfa say: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Nabidh made in green earthenware jars.' I said: 'And white ones?' He said: 'I do not know",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5621-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Shadh"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5621-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Shadh"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5621-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Bukhari"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b198",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5622,
      "bookHadithIndex": 84,
      "text": "Abu Ishaq Ash-Shaibani said:\"I heard Ibn Abi Awfa say: 'The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Nabidh made in green and white earthenware jars",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5622-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5622-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5622-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b199",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5623,
      "bookHadithIndex": 85,
      "text": "It was narrated that Abu Raja' said:\"I asked Al-Hasan about Nabidh made in earthenware jars - is it unlawful? He said: '(It is) unlawful. One who would not lie narrated to us that the Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Nabidh made in Al-Hantam, Ad-Dubba' (gourds), Al-Muzaffat and An-Naqir",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5623-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Lighairihi"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5623-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5623-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b19a",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5624,
      "bookHadithIndex": 86,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn 'Umar that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Ad-Dubba' (gourds)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5624-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5624-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5624-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b19b",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5625,
      "bookHadithIndex": 87,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn 'Umar that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Ad-Dubba' (gourds)",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5625-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5625-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5625-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Hasan"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b19c",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5626,
      "bookHadithIndex": 88,
      "text": "It was narrated that 'Aishah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Ad-Dubba' (gourds) and Al-Muzaffat",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5626-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5626-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5626-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b19d",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5627,
      "bookHadithIndex": 89,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Ali - may Allah honor his face - that:The Prophet [SAW] forbade Ad-Dubba' (gourds) and Al-Muzaffat",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5627-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5627-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5627-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih - Agreed Upon"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b19e",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5628,
      "bookHadithIndex": 90,
      "text": "It was narrated from 'Abdur-Rahman bin Ya'mar that:The Prophet [SAW] forbade Ad-Dubba' and Al-Muzaffat",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5628-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5628-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih Isnaad"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5628-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Isnaad Sahih"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b19f",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5629,
      "bookHadithIndex": 91,
      "text": "It was narrated from Anas bin Malik that:The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade soaking (fruits) in Ad-Dubba' (gourds) and Al-Muzaffat",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5629-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5629-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5629-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b1a0",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5630,
      "bookHadithIndex": 92,
      "text": "Abu Hurairah said:\"The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade soaking (fruits) in Ad-Dubba' (gourds) and Al-Muzaffat",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5630-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5630-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5630-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
          "grade": "Sahih Muslim"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "69b6c6d6dd1a4c9c86f0b1a1",
      "editionId": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321",
      "bookIndex": 51,
      "hadithIndex": 5631,
      "bookHadithIndex": 93,
      "text": "It was narrated from Ibn 'Umar that :The Messenger of Allah [SAW] forbade Al-Muzaffat and squashes",
      "grades": [
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5631-abughuddah",
          "name": "Abu Ghuddah",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5631-alalbani",
          "name": "Al-Albani",
          "grade": "Sahih"
        },
        {
          "id": "69b55e8d6f42ba7ccb2a1321-51-5631-zubairalizai",
          "name": "Zubair Ali Zai",
